@CloudTask_HostAddress = https://localhost:7011
@TaskId = 1

### Create a task
POST {{CloudTask_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Azure SQL Project",
  "description": "Implement and test CRUD endpoints",
  "status": "Pending",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-15T12:00:00Z"
}

### List tasks with default paging and sorting
GET {{CloudTask_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Filter, search, sort, and paginate tasks
GET {{CloudTask_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?status=Pending&priority=High&search=azure&sortBy=dueDate&sortDirection=asc&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Get dashboard statistics
GET {{CloudTask_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/stats
Accept: application/json

### Get one task (set TaskId to an existing ID)
GET {{CloudTask_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{TaskId}}
Accept: application/json

### Replace a task's editable fields
PUT {{CloudTask_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{TaskId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Azure SQL Project",
  "description": "CRUD and documentation are ready for review",
  "status": "InProgress",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-16T12:00:00Z"
}

### Change only a task's status
PATCH {{CloudTask_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{TaskId}}/status
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### Delete a task permanently
DELETE {{CloudTask_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{TaskId}}
Accept: application/json
